                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Summary.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <p>Decree No. 83 of January 31, 1913, repeals Decree No. 758 of August 14, 1012,
                    which suspended Decree No. 556 of June 18, 1912; this renewal of the operation
                    of No. 556 is made in view of the withdrawal of the objections that had been
                    made [by the United States] thereto, and in view of the amended interpretation
                    to be given that decree, agreed to by the concessionaire, and here stipulated
                    [embodying the amendments mentioned in the instruction of January 11, 1913, to
                    the American Minister].</p>
            </div>
        </body>
